Makes the two policy fragments of the Citadel gateway-upgrade module that send usage records to an Event Hub conditional.

The fragments ai-usage and pii-state-saving log to an Event Hub through two loggers (usage-eventhub-logger and
pii-usage-eventhub-logger) that the kit's own deployment makes together with the Event Hub, and the API Management service
refuses to save a fragment whose logger does not exist. The module does not make the loggers, and the service refuses a
logger whose address does not resolve. The Event Hub belongs to the usage recording (an Event Hub, a Logic App and a Cosmos
DB), which the workflow's action "recording" makes, and no API that the module makes here includes either fragment.

The patch adds one parameter to bicep/infra/modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep, deployUsageRecordingFragments, which is
false: the two fragments are created only when it is true. A second hunk adds the same parameter to the module's own
bicep/infra/apim-gateway-upgrade/main.bicep and passes it on, so that the workflow can turn it on, which it does only when both
loggers exist in the instance (the action "gateway-prepare" makes them once the Event Hub exists). It applies to the kit at
the commit that the workflows check out (Azure-Samples/ai-hub-gateway-solution-accelerator, citadel-v1); the checks apply it for real.

diff --git a/bicep/infra/apim-gateway-upgrade/main.bicep b/bicep/infra/apim-gateway-upgrade/main.bicep
--- a/bicep/infra/apim-gateway-upgrade/main.bicep
+++ b/bicep/infra/apim-gateway-upgrade/main.bicep
@@ -86,6 +86,12 @@ param enableAIModelInference bool = true
 @description('Enable the Unified AI Wildcard API (3rd API alongside Azure OpenAI and Universal LLM)')
 param enableUnifiedAiApi bool = true
 
+// Meternaut: the two fragments that send usage records to an Event Hub (ai-usage and pii-state-saving) are not created
+// unless this is true. They need the loggers usage-eventhub-logger and pii-usage-eventhub-logger in the instance, which
+// this module does not make. The workflow turns it on only when both loggers exist.
+@description('Create the policy fragments that send usage records to an Event Hub')
+param deployUsageRecordingFragments bool = false
+
 @description('Enable JWT authentication support across all APIs (creates JWT named values and security-handler fragment)')
 param enableJwtAuth bool = false
 
@@ -426,6 +432,7 @@ module policyFragments '../modules/apim/policy-fragments.bicep' = if (updatePoli
     enablePIIAnonymization: enablePIIAnonymization
     enableAIModelInference: enableAIModelInference
     enableUnifiedAiApi: enableUnifiedAiApi
+    deployUsageRecordingFragments: deployUsageRecordingFragments
   }
   dependsOn: [
     piiServiceUrlNamedValue

